      "content": "This agreement is not a static document. Articulations may be updated or added at any time , and the information provided is subject to change without notice. This agreement does not include upper-division major requirements, course prerequisites, general education coursework, or university-specific graduation requirements necessary for degree completion. Department agreements should be referenced alongside major agreements to ensure a clearer understanding of course articulation and program planning.",
